    {
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.controls_how_strongly_sharpening_is_reduced_acro_49743ae3",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "section": "menu-common",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Controls how strongly sharpening is reduced across depth edges.\n\nHigher values more aggressively prevent sharpening across object boundaries (reduces halos).\nLower values allow more sharpening to pass across edges (sharper but riskier).",
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "line_breaks": true,
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
          "line": 5531,
          "kind": "presentation-binding"
        },
        {
          "path": "OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
          "line": 5559,
          "kind": "presentation-binding"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Contrôle la force avec laquelle la netteté est réduite sur les bords de profondeur.\n\nDes valeurs plus élevées empêchent plus agressivement la netteté sur les limites des objets (réduit les halos).\nDes valeurs plus basses permettent à plus de netteté de passer à travers les bords (plus net mais plus risqué).",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
