      "surface": "in_game",
      "section": "menu-common",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Minimum motion required before motion-based sharpening adjustment begins.\n\nHigher values ignore small movements (more stable).\nLower values react to subtle motion (more sensitive).",
