    {
      "id": "ingame.menu-common.use_depth_aware_sharpening_das_depth_aware_direc_1d0c0193",
      "surface": "in_game",
      "section": "menu-common",
      "control": "paragraph",
      "english": "Use Depth Aware Sharpening (DAS)\nDepth-aware directional adaptive luma sharpener\nSmarter sharpening with less artifacts,\nbut also heavier\n\nThe farther away is the object, the more\nsharpening is applied",
      "context": "Current UI: OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
      "placeholders": [],
      "preserve": [],
      "line_breaks": true,
      "revision": 1,
      "sources": [
        {
          "path": "OptiScaler/menu/menu_common.cpp",
          "line": 5483,
          "kind": "presentation-binding"
        }
      ],
      "translation": "Utiliser Depth Aware Sharpening (DAS)\nFiltre de netteté luma adaptatif directionnel sensible à la profondeur\nNetteté plus intelligente avec moins d'artefacts,\nmais aussi plus lourde\n\nPlus l'objet est éloigné, plus\nla netteté est appliquée",
      "note": "Machine draft; semantic and native-speaker review pending."
    },
